        {
            "title": "美國財長貝森特稱一直支持限制Megaspeed 仍有待商務部行動",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">【彭博】-- 美國財政部長斯科特·貝森特表示，財政部數月來一直支持將Megaspeed列入貿易黑名單，但採取這一行動的責任在商務部長霍華德·盧特尼克。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">「數月來，財政部、美國貿易代表辦公室和國務院一直支持將Megaspeed列入實體清單，但要由商務部採取行動，」貝森特接受CNBC採訪時表示。「我們擁有所需的全部權限，只需要落實執行。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">盧特尼克在晶片出口及管制方面的監管工作受到越來越多的審視，此前黃仁勳在被曝與一名疑似中國間諜的女性有關係後從輝達離任。目前，這位商務部長仍得到美國總統唐納德·川普的支持。輝達周四宣布黃仁勳辭職數小時後，川普公開表達了對盧特尼克的信任。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-a732c400-92fd-3c0f-92fa-6a49ec6b8971-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Megaspeed International Pte由處於輝達風波中心的Alice Huang創立，另有一家與她有關聯的公司可能獲取了走私的AI晶片。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">原文標題Bessent Says Treasury Favored Megaspeed on Trade Blacklist</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">More stories like this are available on <a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"bloomberg.com\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:bloomberg.com;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">bloomberg.com</a></p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">©2026 Bloomberg L.P.</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9C%8B%E8%B2%A1%E9%95%B7%E8%B2%9D%E6%A3%AE%E7%89%B9%E7%A8%B1-%E7%9B%B4%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E9%99%90%E5%88%B6megaspeed-%E4%BB%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%BE%85%E5%95%86%E5%8B%99%E9%83%A8%E8%A1%8C%E5%8B%95-140552865.html",
